        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION 29TH SEPTEMBER @ 13:00pm AMV 300,000\n**CASH BUYERS ONLY**\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS offer to the market this extended three bedroom end terrace property with an additional unit to rear situated on Rowlagh Crescent, Clondalkin. Located in the Rowlagh Development, this property finds itself within walking distance of a wide array of local amenities including schools, shops and recreational facilities, not to mention having Liffey Valley Shopping Centre within arm's reach. The M50 motorway is very easily accessible and there are a host of bus routes to the front of the development. With internal living accommodation of c. 102 Sqm, in brief this property consists on entrance hall, living room, kitchen/diner and rear extension offering another reception room with downstairs shower room. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms and a family bathroom. Externally this property offers a large unit to rear (c. 48 sqm) offering a variety of uses, you will also find a side storage unit/garage with access to the front which offers a gated driveway. This property comes to the market in need of full renovation throughout but provides a fantastic opportunity whether it be for further development or its strong rental yields available.\n\nIF YOU WISH TO REGISTER FOR THE UPCOMING AUCTION PLEASE CONTACT THE AGENT FOR FURTHER INFORMATION AND TO PAY A REGISTRATION DEPOSIT.\n\n*FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION 29TH SEPTEMBER @ 13:00pm AMV 300,000\n\nKey Features\nCash buyers only\nBer E\nc. 152 Sqm combined\nNo onward chain\nExtended to rear\nDriveway to Front\nClose to amenities\nFantastic opportunity\nAuction reserve 300,000\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nD22 A3A8"
